.DS_Store
.venv/
.venv310/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.harness/runs/
.harness/logs/
.pytest_cache/
.harness/requests/
# The outbox queue, and this one is ignored rather than merely untracked for a
# reason the entries beside it do not need: every clean-tree pre-flight reads
# git status --porcelain, which reports untracked files, so a pending entry
# that was only untracked would dirty the tree and refuse the next run — the
# mechanism whose whole purpose is never to block would be the thing blocking.
.harness/outbox/
# The receipt index, ignored for the queue's reason above and for one of its
# own: a sweep runs inside a run — in the l5-run pre-flight and again after the
# completion commit — so a versioned index would write a new file into a
# tracked directory mid-run, and the next run's clean-tree pre-flight would
# refuse it. The cost is accepted: receipts do not survive a fresh clone, so a
# clone loses local dedupe until it files again.
.harness/receipts/
